solutions.body:
Look at the hole as seen from the back:

- the top edge has a bump sticking **out** (a tab), left of the middle;
- the left edge has a tab;
- the right edge has a tab, low down;
- the bottom edge has a dent, where the piece below pokes in, right of the middle.

Turning the piece over swaps left and right. So from the front the piece has a tab on the top right of the middle, a tab high on the right, a tab low on the left, and a dent on the bottom left of the middle. That is piece C.

**Answer: (C)**
